WEBVTT

00:13:28.447 --> 00:13:30.326
reach out for connections.

00:13:31.233 --> 00:13:34.598
It could even be
a quiet walk in the fynbos

00:13:35.485 --> 00:13:39.969
to see if a certain plant
speaks up to you.

00:13:39.993 --> 00:13:41.159
That happens.

00:13:41.183 --> 00:13:42.793
They speak to me all the time.

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:46.493
And most of all,

00:13:46.517 --> 00:13:51.271
love is to trust that
these little exploratory steps

00:13:51.295 --> 00:13:54.812
have the potential to lead us
to something larger,

00:13:55.738 --> 00:13:58.605
sometimes to really surprising answers.

00:13:59.756 --> 00:14:02.981
An indigenous medicine woman once told me